          %p
            Review of interpretation of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+holes+in+string+theory"} black holes in string theory
            includes
          %ul
            %li#AGMOO
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ofer+Aharony"}> Ofer Aharony
                , S. S. Gubser,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juan+Maldacena"} Juan Maldacena
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hirosi+Ooguri"} Hirosi Ooguri
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Large N field theories, string theory and gravity
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9905111"} arXiv:hep-th/9905111
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Per+Kraus"}> Per Kraus
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Lectures on black holes and the
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
