              %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0512048"}> arXiv:hep-th/0512048
              )
          %p See also
          %ul
            %li
              MO question,
              %a{:href => "http://mathoverflow.net/questions/31789/statistical-physics-of-string-theory"} statistical-physics-of-string-theory
          %h3#interpretation_as_entanglement_entropy Interpretation as entanglement entropy
          %p
            Discussions of the interpreation of BH entropy as
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holographic+entanglement+entropy"} holographic entanglement entropy
          %ul
            %li
              Alejandro Satz,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ted+Jacobson"} Ted Jacobson
              = succeed "," do
                %em Black hole entropy and the renormalization group
              = succeed "," do
                %em The Thirteenth Marcel Grossmann Meeting
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1301.3171"} arXiv:1301.3171
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1142/9789814623995_0188"} doi:10.1142/9789814623995_0188
          %p
            Computation of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+hole+entropy"} black hole entropy
            in 4d via
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/AdS4-CFT3+duality"} AdS4-CFT3 duality
            from
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holographic+entanglement+entropy"} holographic entanglement entropy
            in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ABJM+theory"} ABJM theory
            for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-brane"} M2-brane
            is discussed in
          %ul
            %li
              Jun Nian, Xinyu Zhang,
              %em Entanglement Entropy of ABJM Theory and Entropy of Topological Black Hole
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1705.01896"}> arXiv:1705.01896
              )
          %div
            %h3#EntanglementIslandProposalForBHInformationParadox Entanglement island proposal for BH information paradox
            %h4#claims Claims
            %p
              Claim that the proper application of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/holographic+entanglement+entropy"} holographic entanglement entropy
              to the discussion of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bekenstein-Hawking+entropy"} Bekenstein-Hawking entropy
              resolves the apparent
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+hole+information+paradox"} black hole information paradox
              via the appearance of “entanglement islands”:
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Geoff+Penington"}> Geoff Penington
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stephen+Shenker"} Stephen Shenker
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Douglas+Stanford"} Douglas Stanford
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Zhenbin+Yang"} Zhenbin Yang
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Replica wormholes and the black hole interior
                  %strong 2022
                  205 (2022) [
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/JHEP05(2020)013"}> doi:10.1007/JHEP05(2020)013
                  ,
                  = succeed "]" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.11977"} arXiv:1911.11977
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ahmed+Almheiri"}> Ahmed Almheiri
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Thomas+Hartman"} Thomas Hartman
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juan+Maldacena"} Juan Maldacena
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edgar+Shaghoulian"} Edgar Shaghoulian
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Amirhossein+Tajdini"} Amirhossein Tajdini
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Replica Wormholes and the Entropy of Hawking Radiation
                  %strong 2020
                  13 (2020) [
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/JHEP05(2020)013"}> doi:10.1007/JHEP05(2020)013
                  ,
                  = succeed "]" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.12333"} arXiv:1911.12333
            %p Review aimed at readers with minimal background:
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ahmed+Almheiri"}> Ahmed Almheiri
                ,
                = succeed "," do
